        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "After the events of the first game, you awaken from a coma to find that the Third Street Saints have all but disappeared. Much like Saints Row, you are charged with retaking the city from three rival gangs, only this time as the leader of the saints. While fighting the Sons of Samedi, The Brotherhood, and The Ronin, the Saints also antagonize the Ultor Corporation, which seeks to eradicate gang violence in Stilwater once and for all.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Tras los acontecimientos del primer juego, despiertas de un coma y descubres que los Third Street Saints casi han desaparecido. Como en Saints Row, debes recuperar la ciudad de tres bandas rivales, solo que esta vez como líder de los Saints. Mientras luchas contra los Sons of Samedi, The Brotherhood y The Ronin, los Saints también se enfrentan a la Ultor Corporation, que busca erradicar de una vez por todas la violencia de las bandas en Stilwater.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
